<h2>Asobi Review 0.9 (build 897)</h2>
<ul>
<li>The Share window says when a review is <b>not being recorded by the studio watcher</b> &#8212; the watcher unreachable from here, or refusing &#8212; instead of failing quietly.</li>
<li>The Google Drive sharing check before a delivery asks about one folder, in seconds, and is time-boxed: a Drive that doesn&#8217;t answer says so instead of leaving &#8220;Checking Google Drive&#8230;&#8221; on screen.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
